### Generate MBTile for given user list
POST https://localhost:8443/vectorTile/generateTiles
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
#  "listID": 1394 // 1 locations - Esri415
#  "listID": 1385 // 64 locations - Does This Process 2
#  "listID": 2084 // 199436 locations - LLP Cocoa Generic Indonesia 200k
#  "listID": 2085 // 200064 locations - LLP Cocoa Generic Brasil 200k

{
  "listID": 1385
}


### Get generated tiles from s3 or start the process
GET https://localhost:8443/vectorTile/1385
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### Get List MBTile file Name
POST https://localhost:8443/vectorTile/getListMbtileInfo
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "listID": 1385
}
